      "title": "Implement RFC 0061 desktop slider registry migration",
      "role_id": "implementer",
      "lane_id": "claude",
      "fresh_session_required": true,
      "objective": "Land RFC 0061 §1-§5: extend kayakgen/ui/parameter_metadata.py with VIEW_PARAMETER_METADATA (target_speed_kt) and fall-back-through-both-registries label_with_unit / description helpers; create kayakgen/ui/desktop_slider_ranges.py with SLIDER_RANGES, SLIDER_STEPS, SLIDER_DEFAULTS (byte-equal to today's desktop literals); rewrite kayakgen/ui/desktop.py KayakGUI.SLIDERS/DEFAULTS/GLOBAL_RANGES/SLIDER_STEPS/_NON_HULL_GUI_KEYS to derive from the registries, replace _hull_from_gui_params call sites with a small _hull_from_params helper using canonical Hull keys; update kayakgen/ui/pv_window.py to drop the _hull_from_gui_params import; shrink kayakgen/ui/gui_params.py to a DeprecationWarning shim with empty GUI_TO_HULL; add tests/test_desktop_sliders_use_registry.py covering the five RFC 0061 §5 assertions; update tests/test_gui_params.py to use canonical Hull keys and assert the deprecation warning. Closes D043's named desktop-migration follow-up.",
