      "objective": "Verify the implementer's changes satisfy RFC 0061 acceptance criteria and close D043's named desktop-migration follow-up: VIEW_PARAMETER_METADATA carries the target_speed_kt entry; SLIDER_RANGES / SLIDER_DEFAULTS numeric values are byte-equal to the pre-RFC desktop literals; KayakGUI.SLIDERS / DEFAULTS / GLOBAL_RANGES derive from the registries; no remaining _GUI_TO_HULL imports in desktop.py or pv_window.py; gui_params.hull_from_gui_params emits a DeprecationWarning naming RFC 0061; tests/test_desktop_sliders_use_registry.py pins the five §5 assertions; tests/test_gui_params.py uses canonical Hull keys; the four-test verification suite passes. Produce REVIEW.md with verdict.",
